Get a Second Phone Number for Texts now!

Second Phone Number offers the convenience of having an extra phone number for personal and professional use, all with no need for an additional SIM card. This app enables you to select a second phone number and send messages without revealing your primary number.

Forget about the hassle of buying and switching SIM cards just to send messages from a different number. 

Maintain your international number for as long as you want and top up your balance with more minutes and SMS at great rates. 

Use the Second Phone Number app to replace your real phone number in various scenarios, such as:
• Selling items on local online marketplaces;
• Business purposes, like a separate work contact;
• Dating situations for added privacy;
• Renting accommodations or vehicles anonymously;
• Registering on online platforms without disclosing your personal number.

Keep your trusted contacts informed about your primary number while using the Second Phone Number for everyone else!

Key Features:
— Obtain a secondary phone number for texts;
— Send messages with US and Canadian numbers;
— Set Business Hours and manage incoming calls effectively;
— Send and view text messages;
— Select your preferred second number from the available options;
— Sync contacts with the app for convenience;
— Easily identify and locate numbers;
— Add new numbers effortlessly.

The call functions will be available at the end of May 2024. 

